    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this data",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Simulated stock. Closing stock is the end of the Cairo day; oversold units are a lower bound; cancelled orders do not return stock (reserve-on-order); demand on empty shelves is flagged with the stock when the minute was written, which a replay can change."
      }
